' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
allowmixing
title Proposed — Use-case realization through owner contracts
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

usecase "UC-D03: protected retrieval" as U
component "Sharing\nRetrieveRepresentation / current viewer eligibility" as S
interface "Presentation\nResolvePublication contract" as P
interface "Files\nResolveUsableArtifact / controlled delivery contract" as F
interface "Applicable current identity / scope contract" as I
U ..> S : realized through this collaboration
S --> P : exact selected publication
S --> F : exact usable artifact and protected serving
S --> I : applicable current scope; employer context stays link-scoped
note bottom of S
 Public contracts, not private ORM/table access or remote service requirement.
 Missing variant is not permission to return a draft, another language or old PDF.
end note

